?p=1272731#post1272731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Goblin Queen is not an entitlement, there is no restriction on how many people can have it and you don't even have to be a Changeling to end up with the condition.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do appreciate that; I'm more going for an in-universe feel with the idea that Goblin Queen can be mistaken for something like the Queen Of Hearts, since a Changeling is adopting a new title...but it's not an actual Entitlement, and it comes with a great deal of trappings that really don't make it worthwhile for a Changeling unless they specifically want it.<br /> <br /> My questions were on what was supposed to be Dead On Arrival.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-05T06:23:18-08:00","id":1272960,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taidragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1271113-entitlements-preview?p=1272746#post1272746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I do appreciate that; I'm more going for an in-universe feel with the idea that Goblin Queen can be mistaken for something like the Queen Of Hearts, since a Changeling is adopting a new title...but it's not an actual Entitlement, and it comes with a great deal of trappings that really don't make it worthwhile for a Changeling unless they specifically want it.<br /> <br /> My questions were on what was supposed to be Dead On Arrival.</div> </div> </div> </div> OK I understand now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T12:55:06-08:00","id":1273133,"title":"","content":"The Bishopric of Blackbirds and a version of The Scarecrow Ministry would make a pretty fantastic dual court system.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-07T17:03:45-08:00","id":1273349,"title":"","content":"I like this. Also, what if some more Fey courts actually have their Monarch be tied to a single legacy Entitlement","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quotin